  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Cost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$450,000, 10,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Rubber\" title=\"Rubber\">rubber</a>, <br />10,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>, <br />150,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Aluminum\" title=\"Aluminum\">aluminum</a>, <br />10,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Glass\" title=\"Glass\">glass</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$1,500,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Production\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>12x <a href=\"/index.php/Glass\" title=\"Glass\">glass</a>, 36x <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic\" title=\"Plastic\">plastic</a>, <br /> 1x <a href=\"/index.php/CPU\" title=\"CPU\">CPU</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>1x <a href=\"/index.php/Television\" title=\"Television\">television</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>3 minutes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Hour</b></td>\n<td>20x <a href=\"/index.php/Television\" title=\"Television\">television</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Profit\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$1,333.33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\n<td>$80,000.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return On Investment/Min</b></td>\n<td>0.076%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Time to ROI</b></td>\n<td>1,315.02 Minutes <br /> (~21 Hours)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Aliases\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">television factory, televisionfactory, tv factory, tv fac\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Sustaining is required use of 1/40 <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic_factory\" title=\"Plastic factory\">Plastic factory</a>, 2/15 <a href=\"/index.php/CPU_factory\" title=\"CPU factory\">CPU factory</a>, 7/24 <a href=\"/index.php/Glass_factory\" title=\"Glass factory\">Glass factory</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008224720\nCac